  "releaseNotes": "Introduces metadata-driven list components for .NET services.\n\t\t\tAdds dynamic column, grid, and action metadata handling.\n\t\t\tProvides CardStack service layer for retrieving grid data and metadata.\n\t\t\tSupports asynchronous data fetching and exception-safe operations.\n\t\t\tIncludes structured logging, trace propagation, and integration-ready service contracts.\n\t\t\tEnables easy extension for custom data sources and business logic.",
